ly Default」- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mickey-joes-relatively-improved-default\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載</a></p>\n<p>步驟 2. 下載 FreshLX 的「Fresh Animations」- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載</a></p>\n<p>步驟 3. 取得此附加模組</p>\n<p>步驟 4. 依照下方所示安裝&nbsp;資源包：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AB1YR7I.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"738\" height=\"432\"></p>\n<p><del>步驟 5. 掃描我的 QR 碼</del></p>\n<p>步驟 6. 享受&nbsp;Barely Default &times; Fresh Animations！</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>YouTube 頻道上的預覽影片 👍</h3>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:638px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pqqLxtn983g?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"638\" height=\"375\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h3>☝ Barely Default x Fresh Animations 宣傳片！&nbsp;☝</h3>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qwA8zsSvjpE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:636px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tz-rY-h0RDY?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"636\" height=\"370\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:638px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bF-Hu2xXpKg?list=PLO6GPyTLxi6tpgNiGLoKuTFc-dggL3w-O&index=1\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WXs2wUiY6gw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1CD4IQ7xho8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Rgiy0jrXzDA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/e-09ofC8Tn8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>非常感謝 <strong>FreshLX</strong> 允許我製作此附加模組！Fresh Animations 絕對完美，能與他合作是我的榮幸。</p>\n<p>這次合作是社群強烈要求的，所以我們一起把它完成了。</p>\n<p>歡迎前往線上關注 FreshLX：</p>\n<p>💰 支持他的作品 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffreshlx\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-Fi.com/FreshLX</a></p>\n<p>🐦 推文動態 - <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fresh_LX\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter.com/Fresh_LX</a></p>\n<p>🌎 PMC 上的專案 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fFreshLX%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">www.PlanetMinecraft.com/member/FreshLX/</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>最後是 MJ 的社群連結：</p>\n<p>💲 贊助油錢 - <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/MushirMickeyJoe\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon.com/MushirMickeyJoe</a></p>\n<p>🦜 最新動態 - <a href=\"https://twitter.com/MushirMickeyJoe\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter.com/MushirMickeyJoe</a></p>\n<p>📷 IG 貼文 - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fMushirMickeyJoe\" rel=\"nofollow\">Instagram.com/MushirMickeyJoe</a></p>\n<p>感謝遊玩！</p>\n<p>特別感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fewanhowell.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ewan Howell</a>，當 Barely Default 的功能出現問題時，他總是樂於協助我 &lt;3</p>\n<p>如果你還在讀這段文字，歡迎前往我的 YouTube 頻道觀看，我承諾終其一生每週都會推出一集我的節目 MJ Trips -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@MushirMickeyJoe\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@MushirMickeyJoe</a></p>",
